         {
            "id": "L-S1E03-C01-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "It's food, man. I'm good. Thanks for sticking with me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E03-C01-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Rafael",
              "version": "Rafael"
            },
            "text": "Nowhere else I'd rather be, bro."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E03-C01-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I don't know. That school was good for you."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E03-C01-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Rafael",
              "version": "Rafael"
            },
            "text": "Lan, you run, I run, period."
          },
           {
            "id": "L-S1E03-C01-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "She hates me, doesn't she?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E03-C01-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Rafael",
              "version": "Rafael"
            },
            "text": "Hope? Probably. You want to explain why you kept lying to her? Why you lied to me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E03-C01-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "That's the problem. I can't. Every time I try to put it into words, all I can say is... it's like the knife wanted me to steal it. And then it wanted me to lie."
          },
           {
            "id": "L-S1E03-C01-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Rafael",
              "version": "Rafael"
            },
            "text": "Knives don't have conscious thoughts, brother."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E03-C01-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I know, but knives don't usually attract dragons either."
          },
           {
            "id": "L-S1E03-C01-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Rafael",
              "version": "Rafael"
            },
            "text": "Um, well, what's done is done. It's not like you're ever gonna see her again anyway. Hey, hey... it's just the two of us. Living off the land. Nothing better."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E03-C01-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "A burger. A burger would be better."
          },
           {
            "id": "L-S1E03-C01-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Rafael",
              "version": "Rafael"
            },
            "text": "A burger would be better."
          }

        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S1E03-C01-T05",
